{"ayah/87-1.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Al-A&#x27;laa 87:1 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Preise den Namen deines höchsten Herrn,\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/87-1.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Al-A&#x27;laa 87:1 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Preise den Namen deines höchsten Herrn,\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/87.html\">Sura Al-A&#x27;laa</a> › Vers 1</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Al-A&#x27;laa 87:1</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ سَبِّحِ اسْمَ رَبِّكَ الْأَعْلَى﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">Preise den Namen deines höchsten Herrn,</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Schaich al-Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أمر بتسبيح ربه ليس أمرا بصيغة معينة.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/117</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهو العلي الأعلى فله أعلى العلو وهو ما فوق العرش<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/101</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s87a1\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/de/ayah/87-3.html\">Nächster Vers (87:3)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/87-3.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Al-A&#x27;laa 87:3 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"und Der das Maß festsetzt und dann rechtleitet\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/87-3.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Al-A&#x27;laa 87:3 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"und Der das Maß festsetzt und dann rechtleitet\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/87.html\">Sura Al-A&#x27;laa</a> › Vers 3</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Al-A&#x27;laa 87:3</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَالَّذِي قَدَّرَ فَهَدَىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">und Der das Maß festsetzt und dann rechtleitet</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فلما كان المقصود الثناء عليه بهذه الأفعال وهي جملة دخلت الواو عاطفة جملة على جملة<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 1/192</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s87a3\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/de/ayah/87-1.html\">Vorheriger Vers (87:1)</a><a href=\"/de/ayah/87-9.html\">Nächster Vers (87:9)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/87-9.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Al-A&#x27;laa 87:9 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"So ermahne -, wenn die Ermahnung nützt.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/87-9.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Al-A&#x27;laa 87:9 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"So ermahne -, wenn die Ermahnung nützt.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/87.html\">Sura Al-A&#x27;laa</a> › Vers 9</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Al-A&#x27;laa 87:9</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فَذَكِّرْ إِن نَّفَعَتِ الذِّكْرَىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">So ermahne -, wenn die Ermahnung nützt.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Schaich al-Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">الوجه الثالث: أن قوله: {الذكرى} يتناول التذكر والتذكير. فإنه قال: {فذكر إن نفعت الذكرى} . فلا بد أن يتناول ذلك تذكيره.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/166</cite></blockquote><h3>Was er von anderen überliefert hat</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الفراء والنحاس والزهراوي والواحدي والبغوي</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «وقيل: ذكر إن نفعت الذكرى وإن لم تنفع. قاله طائفة، أولهم الفراء»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/154</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الفراء والنحاس والزهراوي</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «معناه &quot; وإن لم تنفع &quot; فاقتصر على الاسم الواحد لدلالته على الثاني»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/167</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">مقاتل</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «فذكر وقد نفعت الذكرى»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/154</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s87a9\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/de/ayah/87-3.html\">Vorheriger Vers (87:3)</a><a href=\"/de/ayah/87-10.html\">Nächster Vers (87:10)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/87-10.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Al-A&#x27;laa 87:10 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Bedenken wird jemand, der gottesfürchtig ist.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/87-10.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Al-A&#x27;laa 87:10 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Bedenken wird jemand, der gottesfürchtig ist.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/87.html\">Sura Al-A&#x27;laa</a> › Vers 10</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Al-A&#x27;laa 87:10</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿سَيَذَّكَّرُ مَن يَخْشَىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">Bedenken wird jemand, der gottesfürchtig ist.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Schaich al-Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">يقتضي أن كل من يخشى يتذكر.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/171</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والخشية قد تحصل عقب الذكر وقد تحصل قبل الذكر وقوله: {من يخشى} مطلق. ومن الناس من يظن أن ذلك يقتضي أنه لا بد أن يكون قد خشي أولا حتى يذكر وليس كذلك.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/171</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والتذكر هو الذكر التام الذي يذكره المذكر به وينتفع به.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/158</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s87a10\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/de/ayah/87-9.html\">Vorheriger Vers (87:9)</a><a href=\"/de/ayah/87-14.html\">Nächster Vers (87:14)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/87-14.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Al-A&#x27;laa 87:14 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Wohl ergehen wird es ja jemandem, der sich läutert,\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/87-14.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Al-A&#x27;laa 87:14 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Wohl ergehen wird es ja jemandem, der sich läutert,\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/87.html\">Sura Al-A&#x27;laa</a> › Vers 14</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Al-A&#x27;laa 87:14</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿قَدْ أَفْلَحَ مَن تَزَكَّىٰ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">Wohl ergehen wird es ja jemandem, der sich läutert,</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Schaich al-Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فالتزكية وإن كان أصلها النماء والبركة وزيادة الخير فإنما تحصل بإزالة الشر؛ فلهذا صار التزكي يجمع هذا وهذا.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 10/97</cite></blockquote><h3>Was er von anderen überliefert hat</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الحسن وأبو الأحوص والزجاج</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «من كان عمله زاكيا وقال أبو الأحوص: زكاة الأمور كلها وقال الزجاج: تزكى بطاعة الله عز وجل»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 10/633</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الزجاج</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «تزكى بطاعة الله عز وجل ومعنى الزاكي النامي الكثير.»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 10/633</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">أى تعمل بطاعة الله تعالى، فتصير زاكيا<cite>«إغاثة اللهفان من مصايد الشيطان» 1/50</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وقدم زكاة الفطر على صلاة العيد تقديما لما قدمه في قوله {قد أفلح من تزكى وذكر اسم ربه فصلى} [الأعلى: 14] [الأعلى: 13]<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 2/320</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s87a14\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/de/ayah/87-10.html\">Vorheriger Vers (87:10)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/87.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Sura Al-A&#x27;laa — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tafsir von Sura Al-A&#x27;laa — Die Bedeutungen des Korans in den Worten von Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/87.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/87.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/87.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/87.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" href